# Ported from SimpleGraphs.graph8e4n. Its shape is two components that never touch, so an event's
# ancestry says nothing at all about the other half of the graph.
#
#   a2   b1           c1
#    |  /|            |  \
#   a1   |           c0   d0
#    | \ |
#   a0   b0
#
# The names are the port's: the format reads an event's creator off the first letter of its name,
# so e0..e7 became a0, b0, a1, a2, b1, c0, d0, c1.

roster four  a=1 b=1 c=1 d=1

#  name  self  other-parents
   c1    c0    d0
   b1    b0    a1
   a2    a1    -
   a1    a0    b0
   d0    -     -
   c0    -     -
   b0    -     -
   a0    -     -
